[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3360.309, "timestamp": "00:56:00", "text": "我不會死。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3377.208, "timestamp": "00:56:17", "text": "[清"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3404.23, "timestamp": "00:56:44", "text": "我明天就要出道了。  今天是我最後一次以運動員的身份做自己了。我想應該是那個老運動員。不，這是一個新時代的開始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3410.309, "timestamp": "00:56:50", "text": "嗨。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3412.39, "timestamp": "00:56:52", "text": "我們走吧。三，二。"}]